# 🕹️ Jump & Collect

## 🎮 Game Description

**Jump & Collect** is a simple 2D platformer game where the player controls a character that navigates through a level, collecting items while avoiding obstacles and falling into voids. The goal is to collect as many items as possible before the game ends.

## 📌 Features

- Player movement (left, right, jump)
- Platform-based level design
- Collectible items that increase score
- Enemies to avoid
- Game-over condition when falling into void
- Simple scoring system

